/result
/result-*
*.img
*.img.zst

# Emulator artifacts. `nix run .#vm` writes its disk image into whatever
# directory you launch from, which is usually this one, and it grows to
# hundreds of megabytes.
*.qcow2
*.ppm
*.sock

# Diagnostic captures. Both are written into the working directory by default
# and are snapshots of a moment, not artifacts worth versioning.
tabletop-screen.png
tabletop-photo.jpg

# SPI flash backups taken by `nix run .#flash-spi`. Point-in-time dumps of a
# specific board, not something to version.
spi-backup-*.bin
